    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for that. You mentioned \"friction\" a couple of times. When you're looking at urban modeling, how do you actually quantify that 'friction'? Like, is it just a measure of braking/acceleration cycles, or are there other variables that cause those sudden, unpredictable disruptions in flow?",
